{"seq":2,"slug":"credential-leak-exposure-pipeline","title":"凭据泄露数据生态与暴露面监控管道","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/account-takeover-credential-stuffing-bot-defense/ato-threat-account-trust/credential-leak-exposure-pipeline","wordCount":3577,"readingTime":15,"html":"<h1 id=\"凭据泄露数据生态与暴露面监控管道\">凭据泄露数据生态与暴露面监控管道</h1><p>面向跨境电商的撞库防御，第一步不是拦住机器人，而是先回答一个更底层的问题：<strong>我的用户里，有多少人的密码此刻正在攻击者的字典里？</strong> 凭据泄露不是一个&quot;事件&quot;，而是一个持续运转的灰色产业市场——数据被打包、定价、转卖、清洗、再回流到撞库工具里。暴露面监控（exposure surface monitoring）就是把这条产业流水线的产物，反向对接到你自己的账户体系上，让&quot;已知泄露&quot;在攻击发生前就变成一次强制改密或一次阶梯认证。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>泄露数据生态可以按<strong>采集方式</strong>分成三层，每层的结构、新鲜度和对撞库的价值完全不同：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  A[入侵窃取&lt;br/&gt;Breach Dump] --&gt; D[清洗与重组&lt;br/&gt;Normalize / Dedupe]&#10;  B[撞库收割&lt;br/&gt;Combolist / ULP] --&gt; D&#10;  C[信息窃取木马&lt;br/&gt;Infostealer Log] --&gt; D&#10;  D --&gt; E[打包 / 定价 / 转卖&lt;br/&gt;Marketplace / Telegram]&#10;  E --&gt; F[撞库工具&lt;br/&gt;Stuffing Toolkit]&#10;  F --&gt; G[目标站点登录端点]&#10;  H[暴露面监控管道] --&gt; I[泄露情报源]&#10;  I --&gt; J[域名/账户关联]&#10;  J --&gt; K[风险打分与处置&lt;br/&gt;强制改密 / 阶梯认证 / 通知]&#10;  K --&gt; G\">graph TD\n  A[入侵窃取&lt;br/&gt;Breach Dump] --&gt; D[清洗与重组&lt;br/&gt;Normalize / Dedupe]\n  B[撞库收割&lt;br/&gt;Combolist / ULP] --&gt; D\n  C[信息窃取木马&lt;br/&gt;Infostealer Log] --&gt; D\n  D --&gt; E[打包 / 定价 / 转卖&lt;br/&gt;Marketplace / Telegram]\n  E --&gt; F[撞库工具&lt;br/&gt;Stuffing Toolkit]\n  F --&gt; G[目标站点登录端点]\n  H[暴露面监控管道] --&gt; I[泄露情报源]\n  I --&gt; J[域名/账户关联]\n  J --&gt; K[风险打分与处置&lt;br/&gt;强制改密 / 阶梯认证 / 通知]\n  K --&gt; G</pre><p>按 Have I Been Pwned（HIBP）公开索引的规模，截至 2026 年该服务收录 1,042 起泄露事件、178 亿条地址记录（同一人可出现在多个数据集中，不能直接相加去重）。其中与撞库直接相关的数据集已形成独立品类：2024 年 5 月发布于 Telegram 的 combolist 达 3.615 亿条；一次性 2024–2026 年的六个 stealer log 数据集合计约 7.3 亿条记录，单批最大的是 2025 年 2 月的 ALIEN TXTBASE，2.841 亿条。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>数据源类型</th>\n<th>形成方式</th>\n<th>HIBP 收录规模示例</th>\n<th>典型内容</th>\n<th>对撞库的价值</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>入侵窃取（Breach Dump）</td>\n<td>攻击者攻破某站点数据库</td>\n<td>National Public Data 1.34 亿（2024-04）</td>\n<td>邮箱、口令哈希、PII</td>\n<td>中——哈希需先破解，时效性差</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>撞库收割（Combolist / ULP）</td>\n<td>用已知口令对其他站点批量试登，把成功的 <code>email:password</code> 汇总</td>\n<td>Telegram Combolists 3.615 亿（2024-05）</td>\n<td>明文 <code>email:password</code></td>\n<td>高——直接可用且已验证</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>信息窃取木马（Stealer Log）</td>\n<td>感染终端，从浏览器/凭据管理器导出</td>\n<td>ALIEN TXTBASE 2.841 亿（2025-02）</td>\n<td>明文口令、<strong>会话 Cookie</strong>、自动填充、URL</td>\n<td>最高——含会话令牌，可绕过 MFA</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>这个表最关键的一行是最后一行。2024 年之后，stealer log 取代纯口令库成为撞库攻击的首选原料，原因是它同时交付了<strong>口令</strong>和<strong>已认证的会话 Cookie</strong>。攻击者拿到有效会话 Cookie 后，很多系统根本不会重新校验第二因子——这就是&quot;会话被窃取即等同于账户被接管&quot;的行业现实，也是本 hub 后续章节把会话安全单列讨论的原因。</p>\n<h2 id=\"泄露数据的三类来源与质量分级\">泄露数据的三类来源与质量分级</h2><p>判断一条泄露数据&quot;值不值得进你的监控管道&quot;，看四个维度：<strong>新鲜度</strong>、<strong>是否明文</strong>、<strong>是否已验证有效</strong>、<strong>是否含会话或 PII 副产物</strong>。<strong>Breach Dump</strong> 是历史最悠久的一类，弱点是多数情况下只有哈希：以 bcrypt 或 Argon2 加盐存储的库即使在合理成本内也难以还原明文，故对撞库的边际价值随时间衰减；但若站点用了无盐 MD5/SHA-1，破解几乎即时——这正是 NIST SP 800-63B（2025-08 修订版）要求口令必须用 32 位以上随机盐加可调成本哈希方案存储的原因。</p>\n<p><strong>Combolist（ULP，user:password 列表）</strong> 是产业链的中间产品：它本身就是攻击者用&quot;站 A 的泄露口令&quot;去试&quot;站 B&quot;后筛出的成功对，因此<strong>每一条都经过了一次真实登录验证</strong>。这类数据在 Telegram 频道和私密论坛以订阅制流转（HIBP 收录的 &quot;Combolists Posted to Telegram&quot; 即属此类，3.615 亿条），新鲜度以周计而非年计，对实时防御的价值高于原始 breach dump。</p>\n<p><strong>Stealer Log</strong> 是当前威胁最高的一档。信息窃取木马感染用户终端后，会从浏览器凭据库、Cookie 库、自动填充记录、以及加密货币钱包中一次性导出全部内容。它的数据形态与另外两类有本质区别：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>记录里包含<strong>域名 → 凭据</strong>的映射，攻击者不需要猜用户在哪些站点有账户；</li>\n<li>包含<strong>会话 Cookie</strong>，可以直接劫持已登录会话，绕过口令校验甚至 MFA；</li>\n<li>包含设备指纹、UA、时区等副产物，可用于把撞库请求伪装成&quot;同一台合法设备&quot;；</li>\n<li>感染是持续性的——同一台被感染的机器在清理前会反复上报新数据，导致&quot;同一用户反复出现在新数据集里&quot;。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>因此解析 stealer log 时<strong>不能只取 <code>email:password</code> 字段</strong>。会话 Cookie 的存在意味着：一个用户即使刚刚改过密码，只要他的设备仍在被感染，会话就可能再次被劫持。这就是为什么处置动作里&quot;强制改密&quot;必须和&quot;吊销全部活跃会话&quot;同时执行。</p>\n<h2 id=\"撞库有效性指标与密码重用经济学\">撞库有效性指标与密码重用经济学</h2><p>暴露面监控要能给出<strong>可量化的收益</strong>，否则无法说服业务方投入。核心参数是三个：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span></span>：攻击者掌握的、覆盖&quot;你的用户群&quot;的对数；</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>ρ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\rho</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ρ</span></span></span></span></span>：密码重用率，即这些凭据在你的站点上仍然有效的比例；</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>δ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\delta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0379em;\">δ</span></span></span></span></span>：攻击者针对你的成功率折扣，来自 IP 轮换质量、UA 一致性、请求节奏等伪装能力，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>δ</mi><mo>∈</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\delta \\in (0,1]</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7335em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0379em;\">δ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span></span></span></span></span>。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>预期成功登录次数近似为：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>E</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mtext>ATO</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo><mo>≈</mo><mi>N</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mi>ρ</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mi>δ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">E[\\text{ATO}] \\approx N \\cdot \\rho \\cdot \\delta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">ATO</span></span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6389em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ρ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0379em;\">δ</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>这个式子解释了两件事。第一，<strong>泄露规模 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span></span> 只影响下限</strong>——即使 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span></span> 很大，只要 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>ρ</mi><mo>→</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\rho \\to 0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ρ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span></span></span></span></span>，攻击收益就归零。暴露面监控的全部意义就是压低 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>ρ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\rho</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ρ</span></span></span></span></span>：当你在攻击者之前知道&quot;这 5 万个账户的凭据已泄露&quot;，就可以提前强制改密，把 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>ρ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\rho</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ρ</span></span></span></span></span> 从&quot;被动等待攻击者命中&quot;变成&quot;主动清零&quot;。</p>\n<p>第二，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>δ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\delta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0379em;\">δ</span></span></span></span></span> 受<strong>防守方</strong>影响。阶梯认证、设备指纹、请求节奏检测都是在压 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>δ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\delta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0379em;\">δ</span></span></span></span></span>。所以本 hub 的防御是两条腿：监控管道压 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>ρ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\rho</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ρ</span></span></span></span></span>（消除可利用的凭据），风控与认证压 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>δ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\delta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0379em;\">δ</span></span></span></span></span>（提高每次尝试的成本）。</p>\n<p>一个常在架构评审中被忽略的点是<strong>残留暴露窗口</strong>。若某用户凭据泄露后你只发一封&quot;我们注意到您的账户有风险&quot;的邮件、不做强制处置，则该用户被攻破的概率随时间单调上升，且上升速率正比于其初始有效凭据比例 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>ρ</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\rho_0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ρ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 与攻击者尝试速率 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>λ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\lambda</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span></span></span></span></span> 的乘积。这给出了明确的工程结论：<strong>通知的转化率决定了它作为一项控制的有效性</strong>。行业实践一致表明&quot;仅通知&quot;的改密转化率远低于&quot;登录时强制改密 + 会话吊销&quot;，因此监控管道的输出不应该是邮件队列，而应该是<strong>账户状态机的一次强制转移</strong>——把账户标记为 <code>must_reset_credential</code> 与 <code>revoke_all_sessions</code>。</p>\n<p>由此可给出优先级排序用的加权暴露分（值越大越优先处置）：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>S</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>u</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><msub><mo>∑</mo><mi>i</mi></msub><msub><mi>w</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>⋅</mo><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>⋅</mo><msub><mi>g</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">S(u) = \\sum_i w_i \\cdot f(\\Delta t_i) \\cdot g_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">u</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0497em;vertical-align:-0.2997em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop op-symbol small-op\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∑</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.162em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4003em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2997em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>。其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>w</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">w_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是来源权重（stealer log <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>&gt;</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">&gt;</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5782em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span></span></span></span></span> combolist <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>&gt;</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">&gt;</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5782em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span></span></span></span></span> breach dump），<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f(\\Delta t_i)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 是时间衰减（越新越重），<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>g</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">g_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 表示该条记录是否含会话令牌或已验证标记。这样就能把&quot;这个用户出现在 5 个老 breach dump 里&quot;和&quot;这个用户昨天的 stealer log 里有会话 Cookie&quot;区分开，避免告警被噪声淹没。</p>\n<h2 id=\"暴露面监控管道的工程实现\">暴露面监控管道的工程实现</h2><p>管道分五段：<strong>接入 → 归一化 → 关联 → 打分 → 处置</strong>。关键是第一段接入要同时覆盖&quot;我订阅的泄露情报源&quot;和&quot;用户口令本身是否出现在公共泄露口令集中&quot;。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  S1[情报源接入&lt;br/&gt;breach / combolist / stealer log / API] --&gt; S2[归一化&lt;br/&gt;邮箱小写 / 别名折叠 / unicode 规范化 / 哈希]&#10;  S2 --&gt; S3[关联到自有账户&lt;br/&gt;域名匹配 + alias 映射]&#10;  S3 --&gt; S4[打分&lt;br/&gt;来源权重 x 时效衰减]&#10;  S4 --&gt; S5{风险阈值}&#10;  S5 --&gt;|高| S6[强制改密 + 吊销全部会话 + 登录时阶梯认证]&#10;  S5 --&gt;|中| S7[登录成功后提示更新口令 + 通知]&#10;  S5 --&gt;|低| S8[静默记录 / 聚合指标]&#10;  S6 --&gt; S9[回收指标&lt;br/&gt;MTTR / 改密转化率 / 残留暴露数]&#10;  S7 --&gt; S9&#10;  S8 --&gt; S9\">flowchart TD\n  S1[情报源接入&lt;br/&gt;breach / combolist / stealer log / API] --&gt; S2[归一化&lt;br/&gt;邮箱小写 / 别名折叠 / unicode 规范化 / 哈希]\n  S2 --&gt; S3[关联到自有账户&lt;br/&gt;域名匹配 + alias 映射]\n  S3 --&gt; S4[打分&lt;br/&gt;来源权重 x 时效衰减]\n  S4 --&gt; S5{风险阈值}\n  S5 --&gt;|高| S6[强制改密 + 吊销全部会话 + 登录时阶梯认证]\n  S5 --&gt;|中| S7[登录成功后提示更新口令 + 通知]\n  S5 --&gt;|低| S8[静默记录 / 聚合指标]\n  S6 --&gt; S9[回收指标&lt;br/&gt;MTTR / 改密转化率 / 残留暴露数]\n  S7 --&gt; S9\n  S8 --&gt; S9</pre><p><strong>口令泄露筛查</strong>这一段有现成的、隐私友好的实现：Pwned Passwords 采用 k-anonymity 范围查询。客户端计算口令的 SHA-1（或 NTLM）哈希，<strong>只发送前 5 个十六进制字符</strong>到 <code>GET https://api.pwnedpasswords.com/range/{5位前缀}</code>，服务端返回该前缀下所有哈希后缀及出现次数，客户端在本地比对完整哈希是否命中。5 位前缀空间是 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mn>16</mn><mn>5</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>1,048,576</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">16^5 = 1{,}048{,}576</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">6</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">5</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8389em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span></span><span class=\"mord\">048</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span></span><span class=\"mord\">576</span></span></span></span></span>，每次响应通常约 800 条后缀，命中与否本地判断：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"async function isPwned(password: string): Promise&lt;boolean&gt; {&#10;  const digest = createHash(&quot;sha1&quot;).update(password, &quot;utf8&quot;).digest(&quot;hex&quot;).toUpperCase();&#10;  const prefix = digest.slice(0, 5);&#10;  const suffix = digest.slice(5);&#10;  const res = await fetch(`https://api.pwnedpasswords.com/range/${prefix}`, {&#10;    headers: { &quot;Add-Padding&quot;: &quot;true&quot; },&#10;  });&#10;  const body = await res.text();&#10;  return body.split(&quot;\\n&quot;).some((line) =&gt; line.split(&quot;:&quot;)[0] === suffix);&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">async</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> function</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> isPwned</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">password</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Promise</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">boolean</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> digest</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> createHash</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"sha1\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">).</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">update</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(password, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"utf8\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">).</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">digest</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"hex\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">).</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">toUpperCase</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> prefix</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> digest.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">slice</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">5</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> suffix</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> digest.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">slice</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">5</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> res</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> await</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> fetch</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">`https://api.pwnedpasswords.com/range/${</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">prefix</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">}`</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    headers: { </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"Add-Padding\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"true\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  });</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> body</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> await</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> res.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">text</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> body.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">split</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\\n</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">).</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">some</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">((</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">line</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> line.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">split</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\":\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)[</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">===</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> suffix);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>这里有两个容易被忽略的工程细节。一是 <strong><code>Add-Padding: true</code></strong>：启用后响应会被填充到 800–1000 条，使网络观察者无法从响应长度反推被查询的前缀，从而无法缩小口令搜索空间。二是<strong>不要在每次按键时查询</strong>——逐字符查询会通过请求模式泄露足够信息，应当等到输入完成（例如 <code>onBlur</code>）再查询一次。</p>\n<p><strong>域名级监控</strong>用于回答&quot;我的域下有哪些邮箱出现在泄露里&quot;。这一步必须先完成<strong>域名所有权验证</strong>，否则查询未验证域会返回 HTTP 403。验证有两条可编程路径：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>DNS 方式</strong>：<code>POST /domainVerification/generateDnsToken</code> 得到形如 <code>hibp-verify=dweb_{code}</code> 的 TXT 值，发布到 DNS 后调用 <code>POST /domainVerification/verifyDnsToken</code> 复核（DNS 传播可能需重试）；</li>\n<li><strong>邮件方式</strong>：<code>POST /domainVerification/sendEmail</code> 会向 <code>admin</code> / <code>hostmaster</code> / <code>info</code> / <code>security</code> / <code>webmaster</code> 五个受控别名之一发信，由收件人点击确认。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>验证通过后，<code>GET /breachedDomain/{domain}</code> 返回&quot;别名 → 泄露事件名&quot;的映射（注意：与邮箱查询不同，<strong>包含被标记为 sensitive 的泄露</strong>）。针对 stealer log 还有 <code>/stealerLogsByEmail</code>、<code>/stealerLogsByWebsiteDomain</code>、<code>/stealerLogsByEmailDomain</code> 三个接口，各自有独立且更低的限流，且<strong>任何接口都不返回口令</strong>——这是上游服务在隐私设计上的硬约束。</p>\n<p>由于没有推送通知服务，推荐的接入模式是<strong>低成本轮询 + 触发式查询</strong>：高频轮询免鉴权且被重度缓存的 <code>GET /latestBreach</code>，仅当出现新泄露事件时才去查询自己的域名。这样做把配额花在真正有新数据的时刻，而不是均匀地浪费在无变化的轮询上。</p>\n<p>归一化环节最容易低估的是<strong>别名折叠</strong>：Gmail 的 <code>+tag</code> 与点号变体、企业邮箱别名域、大小写与 Unicode 规范化，都会让同一自然人对应多个字符串。不折叠则同一用户的多次泄露被记成不同账户，风险打分被稀释、处置会漏；折叠过度又会合并不同用户。因此别名映射必须基于你自己的账户表，而非通用规则猜测。</p>\n<h2 id=\"域名验证-隐私保护与合规边界\">域名验证、隐私保护与合规边界</h2><p>暴露面监控本质上是<strong>在处理与你无关的第三方泄露数据</strong>，隐私边界比普通风控更敏感，必须在设计阶段定好。</p>\n<p><strong>最小化与不可逆化。</strong> 上游接口已经给出范式：口令比对采用 k-anonymity（只传 5 位前缀），stealer log 接口不返回口令。你自己的管道同样应遵守——本地只保存&quot;该账户出现在某来源、某时间、某类别&quot;的<strong>判定结果</strong>，不保存原始泄露记录。原始 <code>email:password</code> 对对防御没有额外价值，却把你变成一个新的泄露源。</p>\n<p><strong>口令正确性校验。</strong> NIST SP 800-63B（2025-08 修订）要求校验方在设置或修改口令时，将口令<strong>完整</strong>地与已知泄露口令清单比对，而非只做子串匹配；命中时必须给出拒绝原因并提示更强的口令选择。这把&quot;口令泄露筛查&quot;从可选项变成合规项，也决定了比对逻辑要接进注册/改密流程，而不只是登录风控。</p>\n<p><strong>合规的边界。</strong> 泄露数据中的邮箱、设备标识属于个人信息，处理它需要明确的合法性基础与目的限定（GDPR Art. 5 目的限制、Art. 32 安全处理义务）。允许的处理目的是&quot;保护账户持有人自身的安全&quot;，不允许的用途是&quot;用于营销触达&quot;或&quot;转让给第三方&quot;。实际项目中最常见的越界是：把监控管道关联出的&quot;高风险用户&quot;名单直接喂给营销或增长团队做挽回——这在目的限定上是明确的违规。</p>\n<p><strong>会话吊销不是可选项。</strong> 由于 stealer log 携带会话 Cookie，只做&quot;强制改密&quot;会留下一个已认证会话继续可用。正确的处置原子操作是：<code>revoke_all_refresh_tokens</code> + <code>invalidate_session_cookies</code> + <code>set_must_reset_password</code>，三者要么同时生效，要么不认为处置完成。NIST 对再认证时限的建议（AAL2 约 24 小时整体、1 小时空闲超时）为会话生命周期提供了一个可参照的上界，但<strong>在确认泄露的场景下应当直接吊销，而不是等待自然过期</strong>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>泄露数据生态分三层：<strong>breach dump</strong>（哈希为主、时效差）、<strong>combolist/ULP</strong>（已验证的明文对、价值高）、<strong>stealer log</strong>（明文口令 + 会话 Cookie，可绕过 MFA，价值最高）。HIBP 收录 1,042 起事件、178 亿条地址，stealer log 单批已达 2.8 亿量级（ALIEN TXTBASE，2025-02）。</li>\n<li>撞库的预期收益近似为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>E</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mtext>ATO</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo><mo>≈</mo><mi>N</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mi>ρ</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mi>δ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">E[\\text{ATO}] \\approx N \\cdot \\rho \\cdot \\delta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">ATO</span></span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6389em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ρ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0379em;\">δ</span></span></span></span></span>：监控管道压 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>ρ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\rho</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ρ</span></span></span></span></span>（消除可利用凭据），风控与认证压 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>δ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\delta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0379em;\">δ</span></span></span></span></span>（提高尝试成本），二者互补而非替代。</li>\n<li>口令筛查用 <strong>k-anonymity 范围查询</strong>：只发 SHA-1 前 5 位（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mn>16</mn><mn>5</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>1,048,576</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">16^5 = 1{,}048{,}576</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">6</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">5</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8389em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span></span><span class=\"mord\">048</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span></span><span class=\"mord\">576</span></span></span></span></span> 个前缀），配合 <code>Add-Padding</code> 隐藏查询意图，输入完成后再查而非逐键查询。</li>\n<li>域名监控必须先做<strong>所有权验证</strong>（DNS TXT 或五个受控邮箱别名），未验证域名返回 403；接入推荐&quot;轮询 <code>/latestBreach</code> + 有新事件才查域名&quot;的模式。</li>\n<li>处置动作的核心是<strong>原子性</strong>：强制改密与吊销全部会话必须同时执行，因为 stealer log 的会话令牌可以独立于口令生效。</li>\n<li>隐私边界在设计阶段确定：本地只存判定结果不存原始泄露对；比对按 NIST SP 800-63B（2025-08）要求做完整比对而非子串；个人信息处理限定在&quot;保护账户持有人&quot;这一目的内。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>暴露面监控回答的是&quot;哪些凭据此刻可用&quot;，但它只覆盖了攻击链的前端。这些凭据如何在自动化工具里被批量投送、命中后如何变现、以及账户信任状态如何在注册到高价值操作之间迁移，构成了完整的攻击坐标系——见同章的 <a href=\"ato-attack-taxonomy-stage-chain\">账户接管攻击分类学与变现链路</a> 与 <a href=\"account-trust-level-model\">账户信任分级模型</a>。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"凭据泄露数据生态与暴露面监控管道","id":"凭据泄露数据生态与暴露面监控管道"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"泄露数据的三类来源与质量分级","id":"泄露数据的三类来源与质量分级"},{"level":2,"text":"撞库有效性指标与密码重用经济学","id":"撞库有效性指标与密码重用经济学"},{"level":2,"text":"暴露面监控管道的工程实现","id":"暴露面监控管道的工程实现"},{"level":2,"text":"域名验证、隐私保护与合规边界","id":"域名验证-隐私保护与合规边界"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"账户接管攻击分类学与变现链路","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/account-takeover-credential-stuffing-bot-defense/ato-threat-account-trust/ato-attack-taxonomy-stage-chain"},"next":{"title":"账户信任分级模型与登录风险信号基线","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/account-takeover-credential-stuffing-bot-defense/ato-threat-account-trust/account-trust-level-model"}}